ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Muy buenas, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hoy es el solsticio de verano,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} así
que el sol no se pondrá de noche.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Pues sí que va a estar bien
que haya un día extralargo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Umm{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I don't know if I should be
waking up or going to bed.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Should I
be snacking or snoozing right now?
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is kind of hard
for me to wrap my head around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ah, ¿ya es de noche?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Como aquí el sol no se pone en el
solsticio de verano,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡yo ya no sé si
es de día o de noche,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}C'est déjà la nuit, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Avec le {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstice d'été{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} on ne sait
jamais si c'est l'heure du premier,
du deuxième, ou du troisième dîner !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Oh, ma è già notte?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Il sole non tramonta mai durante
il solstizio d'estate!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non so più
se è giorno o notte, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}It's still light out,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} so if I go to sleep,
does that count as napping or going
to bed,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Veo luz fuera,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} así que si me acuesto,
¿eso cuenta como dormir la siesta o
como ir a dormir,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Il fait encore jour.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Alors si je vais
dormir, ça compte comme une
sieste ou une nuitée,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}C'è ancora luce fuori!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Quindi se ora andassi a dormire,
varrebbe come pisolino o sarebbe
come andare a letto,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Dışarısı hâlâ aydınlık,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} şimdi uyursam
bu kestirme mi sayılır yoksa gece uykusu
mu,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
